{"id":"mae_distance","title":"Mean absolute error","family":"lock-step","definition":"reference","intro_en":"MAE reports the average absolute discrepancy on an aligned time axis. It divides the Manhattan total by the number of compared coordinates, retaining the original amplitude units. The animation shows both the individual absolute gaps and the average, making clear why the same total can imply different typical errors at different lengths.","intro_zh":"MAE 表示对齐时间轴上的平均绝对差。它将曼哈顿总距离除以比较坐标数，仍使用原始幅值单位。动图同时展示各点绝对误差和最终平均值，帮助区分总误差与典型逐点误差。","steps_en":["Keep the two series on the same sample grid; no shift or warping is estimated.","Take each absolute residual; the highlighted point supplies one coordinate contribution.","Accumulate the coordinate contributions in sample order.","Divide the absolute-error sum by sample count."],"steps_zh":["在同一采样网格上比较两条序列，不估计平移或时间规整。","计算各坐标的绝对残差。","按采样顺序累积局部贡献。","绝对差总和除以样本数。"],"formula":"mean_i abs(x_i-y_i)","caveats_en":["Averaging does not remove sensitivity to a systematic time shift.","Sample alignment and amplitude units are part of the comparison protocol."],"caveats_zh":["求平均不能消除系统性的时间偏移影响。","采样对齐和幅值单位属于比较协议的一部分。"],"sources":[{"label":"SciPy: cityblock","url":"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.spatial.distance.cityblock.html"}],"x":[1.0,1.5,2.4,3.7,4.5,3.8,2.6,2.1,2.8,3.8,4.1,3.3],"y":[1.3,1.8,2.0,3.2,5.2,4.4,2.9,1.6,2.6,3.1,4.4,3.9],"input_label":"Deterministic synthetic illustration; sample index is the time axis.","parameters":{"samples":12,"preprocessing":"none","domain":"strictly positive illustration"},"result":{"label":"distance","value":0.45,"detail":"Exact formula evaluation on the displayed aligned vectors."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Aligned samples","panel":{"kind":"lines","title":"Aligned samples","a":[1.0,1.5],"a_label":"x","b":[1.3,1.8],"b_label":"y","marker":1}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Aligned samples","panel":{"kind":"lines","title":"Aligned samples","a":[1.0,1.5,2.4,3.7,4.5],"a_labe